
# APM dependencies
apm_modules/

# Generated/copied orchestration assets (local only)
.github/**
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**
!.github/pull_request_template.md
.agents/

# Agent tracking artifacts.
#
# Default is IGNORED: research, plans, details, changes, and interactive squad
# runs are local scratch and must never be pushed. Nobody has to remember to put
# them anywhere special — the default protects them.
#
# Re-included: the audit trail of an unattended Watch Mode run. Those sub-squads
# are named deterministically (`issue-<N>`, `pr-<N>`, per
# squad-watch-mode.instructions.md) and are the evidence a reviewer checks on the
# pull request. Two levels are needed, because proof-of-dispatch is two-level:
#   squad/members/<name>/     the inner run — decisions, per-role history, consumption
#   squad/history/<name>.md   the federation-level meta-transition entry
# Both are per-event files written by exactly one run, so concurrent runs on
# separate branches never touch the same path.
#
# Deliberately still ignored, even though a run writes them:
#   federation.md, meta-routing.md, state.json   replace semantics — every run
#     rewrites the whole file, so committing them guarantees merge conflicts
#     between concurrent runs. They are rebuildable: Watch Mode Bootstrap Mode
#     reconstructs the registry from the committed member trees.
#   decisions.md, consumption.md, consumption-rates.md (federation root)
#     repo-wide aggregates. The per-run equivalents inside members/<name>/ are
#     committed and are what a reviewer actually reads.
#
# NOTE for future editors: this MUST stay `.copilot-tracking/**` and not
# `.copilot-tracking/`. Git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the directory form silently disables every negation below it.
# Interactive sub-squads (`members/product/`, `members/platform/`, ...) stay local
# by design.
.copilot-tracking/**
!.copilot-tracking/squad/
!.copilot-tracking/squad/history/
!.copilot-tracking/squad/history/issue-*.md
!.copilot-tracking/squad/history/pr-*.md
!.copilot-tracking/squad/members/
!.copilot-tracking/squad/members/issue-*/
!.copilot-tracking/squad/members/issue-*/**
!.copilot-tracking/squad/members/pr-*/
!.copilot-tracking/squad/members/pr-*/**

knowledge-docs/

docs/planning/
tests/tier0/tier0-results.xml
tests/tier1/tier1-results.xml
tests/tier1/tier1-selfcheck-results.xml
tests/tier1/results/
tests/tier2/tier2-selfcheck-results.xml
tests/tier2/tier2-score.json
